  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: June 2026</p>

  <div class="summary-box">
    <strong>Plain-English summary</strong>
    <p>PDF Tools processes all files entirely on your device. We do not collect, store, or transmit your documents to any server. No account is required. The only third-party data collection is anonymized ad data via Google AdMob (free users only) and anonymous purchase events via RevenueCat.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
  <p>PDF Tools is developed and published by Formatly, operated by Youssif Ahmed (Cairo, Egypt). Contact us at <a href="mailto:youssifahmed911business@gmail.com">youssifahmed911business@gmail.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect no personal data directly. The app requires no account, no name, and no email address.</p>
  <p>The following is collected indirectly through third-party SDKs:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google AdMob</strong> — displays ads to free users. AdMob may collect anonymized device identifiers and ad interaction data per <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. Opt out via your device's ad settings.</li>
    <li><strong>RevenueCat</strong> — manages subscription purchases. RevenueCat receives anonymized purchase events to validate Pro entitlements. No document content is ever shared. See <a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy" target="_blank">RevenueCat's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <h2>3. Your documents</h2>
  <p>All PDF processing — merging, splitting, compressing, locking, watermarking, converting — happens entirely on your device using on-device libraries. Your files are never uploaded to any server operated by Formatly or any third party. We have no access to your documents at any point.</p>

  <h2>4. How we use information</h2>
  <p>The anonymized data collected by AdMob and RevenueCat is used solely to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Display relevant advertisements to free-tier users</li>
    <li>Validate subscription status and restore purchases</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell data to any third party. We do not use data for profiling.</p>

  <h2>5. Data stored locally on your device</h2>
  <p>The app stores the following data locally on your device only, using Android's SharedPreferences:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your daily operation count (resets at midnight)</li>
    <li>Onboarding completion status</li>
    <li>Operation history (stored locally, capped at 100 items)</li>
    <li>App preferences and settings</li>
  </ul>
  <p>None of this data is transmitted off your device. Clear it at any time by clearing the app's data in Android Settings, or by uninstalling the app.</p>

  <h2>6. Permissions</h2>
  <p>The app requests the following Android permissions:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>READ_MEDIA_IMAGES / READ_MEDIA_DOCUMENTS</strong> — to let you select PDF and image files for processing</li>
    <li><strong>WRITE permissions</strong> — to save processed output to your Downloads folder via Android's MediaStore API</li>
    <li><strong>POST_NOTIFICATIONS</strong> — optional, used only to notify you when a long operation completes in the background</li>
  </ul>
  <p>No permission is used to access files other than those you explicitly select.</p>

  <h2>7. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>PDF Tools is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect any information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information, contact us and we will delete it promptly.</p>

  <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Because we do not collect personal data directly, most data-rights requests (access, deletion, portability) are satisfied by clearing the app's local data on your device. For questions related to AdMob or RevenueCat data, refer to their respective privacy policies or contact us for assistance.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy when we add new features or if legal requirements change. The "last updated" date at the top reflects any changes. Continued use of the app after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy:<br/>
  <a href="mailto:youssifahmed911business@gmail.com">youssifahmed911business@gmail.com</a></p>
